<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1871484393"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1582292294"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="八月の蛍"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="HACHI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="八月の蛍"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:26.687"><div begin="00:12.299" end="04:26.687"><p begin="00:12.299" end="00:17.728" itunes:key="L1">花火の音を遠くで聴いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听到烟花在远处绽开的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na bi no o to wo to o ku de ki i ta</span></p><p begin="00:17.729" end="00:22.684" itunes:key="L2">八月の終わり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">八月已迎来终焉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha chi ga tsu no o wa ri</span></p><p begin="00:22.685" end="00:27.665" itunes:key="L3">わずかに光る 蛍の灯り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">萤火虫绽放微弱的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa zu ka ni hi ka ru ho ta ru no a ka ri</span></p><p begin="00:27.666" end="00:31.017" itunes:key="L4">ふわり舞い上がる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻盈地飞舞而起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu wa ri ma i a ga ru</span></p><p begin="00:33.143" end="00:38.477" itunes:key="L5">「さよなら」に返事もない奴だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">未曾对“再见”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 sa yo na ra 」 ni</span></p><p begin="00:38.478" end="00:44.020" itunes:key="L6">待ちぼうけするのもこれが最後だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这已是我最后一次为他痴痴等待了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma chi bo u ke su ru no mo ko re ga sa i go da</span></p><p begin="00:44.021" end="00:48.506" itunes:key="L7">闇の中 点滅し チカチカ泣いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黑暗之中 迎着闪烁的光芒落下泪水</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya mi no na ka te n me tsu shi chi ka chi ka na i ta</span></p><p begin="00:48.507" end="00:51.577" itunes:key="L8">僕は八月の蛍火<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我恍若八月的萤火虫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha ha chi ga tsu no ho ta ru bi</span></p><p begin="00:53.096" end="00:53.952" itunes:key="L9">ねぇ、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 哪怕更加依赖我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mo 't to su ga 't te ku re te mo</span></p><p begin="00:53.953" end="00:59.001" itunes:key="L10">もっと縋ってくれても良いんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再多陪在我身边一会也没关系哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mo 't to su ga 't te ku re te mo</span></p><p begin="00:59.002" end="01:03.839" itunes:key="L11">光って光って消えゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te hi ka 't te ki e yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:03.840" end="01:09.517" itunes:key="L12">終わってしまえば優しい記憶が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那段温柔的记忆会在一切迎来终焉时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa 't te shi ma e ba ya sa shi i ki o ku ga</span></p><p begin="01:09.518" end="01:12.735" itunes:key="L13">何度もよぎってゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无数次闪现于我的脑海</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo yo gi 't te yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:25.299" end="01:35.910" itunes:key="L14">祭囃子の喧騒が止む 午前二時の町<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祭典的锣鼓声已然止息</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma tsu ri ba ya shi no ke n so u ga ya mu</span></p><p begin="01:35.911" end="01:40.624" itunes:key="L15">提灯だけが列を成してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能看到那排列整齐的灯笼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cho u chi n da ke ga re tsu wo na shi te ru</span></p><p begin="01:40.625" end="01:44.347" itunes:key="L16">ぼんやりした夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让夜晚愈发氤氲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo n ya ri shi ta yo ru</span></p><p begin="01:46.422" end="01:51.527" itunes:key="L17">羽休め それだけの二人だった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人的关系只停驻于须臾一瞬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ne ya su me so re da ke no fu ta ri da 't ta</span></p><p begin="01:51.528" end="01:56.824" itunes:key="L18">僕はまだ 傷口が癒えないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍怀揣那道未曾愈合的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha ma da ki zu gu chi ga i e na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="01:56.825" end="02:01.534" itunes:key="L19">闇の中 舞い上がり ゆらゆら飛んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黑暗之中 悠悠曳曳地飞舞而上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya mi no na ka ma i a ga ri yu ra yu ra to n da</span></p><p begin="02:01.535" end="02:04.851" itunes:key="L20">君は追いかけてはくれない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可你始终不曾追逐而来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ha o i ka ke te ha ku re na i</span></p><p begin="02:06.161" end="02:07.005" itunes:key="L21">ねぇ、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 都是因为我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne cha n to</span></p><p begin="02:07.006" end="02:12.094" itunes:key="L22">ちゃんと好きって言わないせいだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾好好对你言说倾慕之情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne cha n to</span></p><p begin="02:12.095" end="02:16.960" itunes:key="L23">光って光って彷徨う<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能在璀璨的光芒中不住徘徊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te hi ka 't te sa ma yo u</span></p><p begin="02:16.961" end="02:22.479" itunes:key="L24">終わってしまえば応えはないのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管一切迎来终焉时也不曾得到回应</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o wa 't te shi ma e ba ko ta e ha na i no ni</span></p><p begin="02:22.480" end="02:26.076" itunes:key="L25">何度も振り向いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我仍无数次回首张望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo fu ri mu i ta</span></p><p begin="02:31.582" end="02:36.689" itunes:key="L26">ゆらゆら飛んだ チカチカ泣いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悠悠曳曳飞舞着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra yu ra to n da</span></p><p begin="02:36.690" end="02:48.542" itunes:key="L27">一筋の燈と ぼんやりした夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一束光芒倾洒 让夜晚越发氤氲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to su ji no to mo shi bi to bo n ya ri shi ta yo ru</span></p><p begin="02:48.543" end="03:07.177" itunes:key="L28">光って、光って、光って…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪耀吧 闪耀吧 竭力闪耀光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te hi ka 't te hi ka 't te</span></p><p begin="03:09.395" end="03:14.775" itunes:key="L29">もっと縋ってくれても良いんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕更加依赖我也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to su ga 't te ku re te mo i i n da yo</span></p><p begin="03:14.776" end="03:19.563" itunes:key="L30">光って光って燃えゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在闪耀的光芒中燃烧殆尽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te hi ka 't te mo e yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:19.564" end="03:25.423" itunes:key="L31">わかっているんだ二人の世界は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我很清楚 你我两人的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te i ru n da fu ta ri no se ka i ha</span></p><p begin="03:25.424" end="03:29.908" itunes:key="L32">ちゃんと壊れてゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经开始分崩离析</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cha n to ko wa re te yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:32.735" end="03:38.237" itunes:key="L33">もっと詰ってしまえば良かった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多希望自己可以多责备你几句</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo 't to na ji 't te shi ma e ba yo ka 't ta</span></p><p begin="03:38.238" end="03:42.827" itunes:key="L34">光って光って落ちゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在闪耀的光芒中坠落而下</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka 't te hi ka 't te o chi yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:42.828" end="03:48.687" itunes:key="L35">揺らいでつたった無数の涙を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽泪水夺眶而出滑落脸颊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ra i de tsu ta 't ta mu su u no na mi da wo</span></p><p begin="03:48.688" end="03:52.342" itunes:key="L36">何度も拭った夜<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数次在夜晚将其拭去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do mo nu gu 't ta yo ru</span></p><p begin="04:04.511" end="04:09.790" itunes:key="L37">花火の音を遠くで聴いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听到烟花在远处绽开的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na bi no o to wo to o ku de ki i ta</span></p><p begin="04:09.791" end="04:14.885" itunes:key="L38">八月の終わり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">八月已迎来终焉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha chi ga tsu no o wa ri</span></p><p begin="04:14.886" end="04:20.193" itunes:key="L39">わずかに光る 蛍の灯り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">萤火虫绽放微弱的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa zu ka ni hi ka ru ho ta ru no a ka ri</span></p><p begin="04:20.194" end="04:26.687" itunes:key="L40">シンと今消えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻已无声地熄灭了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n to i ma ki e ta</span></p></div></body></tt>